{"type":"message","id":"ee9a71e8","parentId":"c5c13e13","timestamp":"2026-06-02T22:33:10.950Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try to figure out what format the POST /send endpoint expects. Maybe it needs specific fields or the error is about something else. Let me check the error 1101 - that's a Cloudflare Workers error that means \"Worker threw exception\".\n\nLet me try different formats for the POST body.","thinkingSignature":"4211650d72fd618a07f17380cfb159990893eb736312e5804a031a6e90eeee10"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_tzbllp88ipv7_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try different POST body formats\necho \"=== Test 1: message field ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"message\":\"heartbeat test\"}'\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Test 2: no threadId in body, query param instead ===\"\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"heartbeat test\"}'\n\necho \"\"\necho \"=== Test 3: check /send endpoint ===\"\ncurl -sv -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"heartbeat\"}' 2>&1 | grep -E \"(HTTP|<)\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":8773,"output":356,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22811,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780439582763,"responseId":"066e8d1ff3b05f714d153994d917fcbd"}}
