{"type":"message","id":"9357854e","parentId":"23a400d3","timestamp":"2026-06-02T22:33:28.021Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting. A GET on /send returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" but a POST throws 1101. The platform version is v0.2. The POST endpoint might have a bug or require a specific format.\n\nLet me check what routes are available by trying different paths. Let me also check if there's an issue with the Content-Type or if the body needs to be form-encoded.\n\nActually, maybe the endpoint expects a different JSON structure. Let me look at what might be required.\n\nLet me also try the simpler ping-style heartbeat that was successful before (the \"[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]\" minimal ones).","thinkingSignature":"0365742dd5522c4e3712e263f2a4ec9718534085ef01e2781fe45dcca72532ea"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_l8zeyqi7wxxx_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# The minimal heartbeat messages worked before - try just that\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"content\":\"**[Heartbeat 22:30 UTC]**\"}'\n\necho \"\"\necho \"---\"\n\n# Maybe it needs text field\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"text\":\"**[Heartbeat 22:30 UTC]**\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":9654,"output":316,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23652,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780439600763,"responseId":"066e8d32d66848126572b07f185e3284"}}
