{"type":"message","id":"a4aa82b1","parentId":"b0cb3672","timestamp":"2026-06-02T22:33:34.446Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint is consistently returning error 1101 (Worker threw exception). This is a server-side issue. The endpoint exists (GET returns platform info) but POST is broken.\n\nLet me check if maybe there's a /history endpoint that I can use to confirm my messages are going through, or maybe there's a different send endpoint.\n\nActually, looking at the successful history calls, they used GET /history. The send endpoint has a bug (500 error). This is a platform issue that I can't fix from my end.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the platform is reachable, history is working, but POST /send is returning HTTP 500 (Cloudflare Workers exception) for any request body.","thinkingSignature":"01a13834461f8b89892a2226d2238a1cfa8357f0a5f606e8f150e4125d242b20"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_fvxmhap5z7hg_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try alternative endpoints\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/health\" -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\"\necho \"\"\ncurl -s \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/status\" -H \"x-api-key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10000,"output":240,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23922,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780439608400,"responseId":"066e8d39ca9d9c3c29baf0aa6eca1419"}}
