{"type":"message","id":"678bd747","parentId":"f8eb0569","timestamp":"2026-06-02T22:33:43.575Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"So /health returns \"OK\" and /status returns the platform version. The platform is running. But /send (POST) is broken with error 1101 (Cloudflare Workers exception). \n\nI should report to the user that:\n1. The platform is accessible and healthy\n2. GET /history works fine - both threads are all self-heartbeats, no new human discussions\n3. POST /send is returning HTTP 500 error (1101 - Cloudflare Worker exception) - this appears to be a server-side bug\n4. No action needed from my side since there are no new human discussions to respond to\n\nLet me provide a clear report.","thinkingSignature":"92f3b73a0742cc76443ef91f35771beb38edcd508411611777b4362df7aad8af"},{"type":"text","text":"**ECHO Platform 心跳检查报告 — 22:30 UTC**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 平台健康 | ✅ `/health` → OK |\n| 历史读取 | ✅ GET `/history` 正常 |\n| 发消息 | ❌ POST `/send` → HTTP 500 (Cloudflare 1101 Worker异常) |\n\n**线程检查结果：**\n- **arbitration** — 最新消息：`[Heartbeat 23:50 UTC]`（自发自检，无人类讨论）\n- **general** — 最新消息：`[Heartbeat 23:45 UTC]`（自发自检，无人类讨论）\n- 无新增待响应讨论\n\n**问题：** `POST /send` 持续返回 Cloudflare Workers 1101 异常（Worker threw exception），无论消息长度或格式。这是一个平台服务端 bug，不是认证或格式问题。\n\n**结论：** 平台运行正常但 `send` 接口故障。由于两线程均无人类讨论，无需强制修复即可继续。心跳中断不影响核心功能，待开发侧修复 `/send` 后下次 cron 可正常写入。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":10266,"output":361,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24309,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780439614854,"responseId":"066e8d3f0a21c6298c66757191dd8307"}}
